      "q": "Who are the largest federal contractors in Alabama?",
      "a": "THE BOEING COMPANY and LOCKHEED MARTIN CORPORATION are the largest federal contractors in Alabama, each with $1.2B in obligations in FY2026 to date. DYNETICS, INC. is the next-largest contractor with $1B. Other top vendors include SCIENCE APPLICATIONS INTERNATIONAL CORPORATION with $508M, NORTHROP GRUMMAN SYSTEMS CORPORATION with $485M, and M1 SUPPORT SERVICES, L.P. with $387M."
